      "answer": "The approved live patch window for Verdant Bay is on 2026-03-24 from 02:00 to 04:00 local time, as explicitly granted and customer approved for the emergency playbook deployment [art_fff67d92fe41].\n\nIf the validation checks fail during the live patch, the rollback procedure is to use the command 'orchestrator rollback --target ruleset=<prior_sha>' which rehydrates the prior ruleset and replays the cache invalidation hook. After rollback, the team must notify Verdant Bay, open an incident for manual remediation, and revert any partial replays [art_fff67d92fe41].\n\nThe validation checks include running 50 synthetic approval flows plus a sample of 50 in-flight approvals marked by the customer. If any validation fails, the rollback is triggered automatically [art_fff67d92fe41].\n\nThus, the rollback is an automated atomic revert to the previous ruleset with post-rollback notification and incident management steps [art_fff67d92fe41].",
