      "answer": "The customer most likely to defect to a cheaper tactical competitor if we miss the next promised milestone is Pioneer Freight Solutions. The exact milestone at risk is the \"Backfill and recompute index weights acceptance milestone\" scheduled by 2026-04-30. This milestone involves running an enrichment backfill with mapping rules and recomputing the index weight table using an automated optimizer, applied to a shadow index. Failure to meet this milestone risks the customer extending a tactical PoC with the competitor NoiseGuard, which is cheaper and addresses immediate noise reduction but lacks the deeper schema-aware remediation and automation that Pioneer Freight requires. The milestone is critical to restoring search relevance and entity graph linking, which directly impacts the customer's executive mandate to reduce manual triage work [art_7373b64fdfdd, art_ac8afb52f2d3].",
